# Runtime configuration for Because Of This Engine V7.1.
# Keep real credentials in the secret manager; never commit them.

# Piper local neural TTS is the canonical narration provider.
# No API key, cloud project or billing account is required for synthesis.
# The workflow downloads the approved voice model explicitly into a temporary
# directory and injects PIPER_MODEL_DIR before the preflight.
# Local synthesis fails closed when the model, dependency or ffmpeg is absent.

# Google Drive OAuth is injected by GitHub Actions secrets:
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET
# GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN
